		<unit label="article" identifier="13.2" level="4">Neighborhood Assistance Act Tax Credit</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>58.1-439.19</section_number>
	<catch_line>Public policy; business firms; donations</catch_line>
	<text>
		It is hereby declared to be public policy of the Commonwealth to encourage business firms to make donations to neighborhood organizations for the benefit of low-income persons.
	</text>
	<history>1981, c. 629, § 63.1-322; 1997, c. 640; 2002, c. 747, § 63.2-2001; 2008, c. 585; 2012, cc. 731, 842.</history>
